  "content": "<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jsg/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/For MC_537047_all.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft 版本\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.justsgmod.eu%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/881802052488011837?style=flat-square&amp;label= &amp;logo=discord&amp;color=2D2D2D\" alt=\"Discord 邀请\"></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChxSgOztJWUVqmw7TcZ-uMg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UChxSgOztJWUVqmw7TcZ-uMg?style=flat-square&amp;label= &amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=ff2129&amp;color=2d2d2d\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/Tau-ri-Dev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-GitHub-2d2d2d?style=flat-square&amp;logo=GitHub&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a><table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <th>\n      <img src=\"https://github.com/Fredyman95/Repository-of-knowledge/blob/main/cf/banner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"机械更新\">\n    </th>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table><table style=\"width:100%\">\n    <tbody><tr>\n        <th>\n            <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.justsgmod.eu%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://files.justsgmod.eu/wiki.png_1674247302.png\" alt=\"wiki 按钮\"></a>\n        </th>\n        <th>\n            <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjustsgmod.eu%252fteam%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://files.justsgmod.eu/team.png_1674247732.png\" alt=\"团队按钮\"></a>\n        </th>\n        <th>\n            <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjustsgmod.eu%252fdownload%252f%2523resourcepacks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://files.justsgmod.eu/resource_pack.png_1674247319.png\" alt=\"材质按钮\"></a>\n        </th>\n        <th>\n            <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoa.justsgmod.eu%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://files.justsgmod.eu/modpack.png_1674247313.png\" alt=\"整合包按钮\"></a>\n        </th>\n        <th>\n            <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.justsgmod.eu%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://files.justsgmod.eu/Discord.png_1674321736.png\" alt=\"Discord 按钮\"></a>\n        </th>\n    </tr>\n</tbody></table><table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <th>\n      <h2>Just Stargate Mod (JSG) 将星际之门宇宙以无与伦比的细节带入我的世界。专为完全沉浸而设计，是当今能找到的最逼真的星际之门模组。</h2>\n    </th>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table><table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td> \n      <img src=\"https://vzge.me/bust/700/171b6e4003d641feac5aa31658de6832.png\"> \n    </td>\n    <td> \n      <h2><strong>JSG 介绍</strong></h2>JSG 是一个源自著名电视剧《星际之门》的模组。该模组在游戏中加入了星际之门和 DHD 等装置。你还会发现用于制造上述装置的多种材料，例如 Trininum、Titanium、Naquadah 等。模组还包含三种 Iris 变体，让你能够保护基地免受不速之客的侵扰。\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table><table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td>\n      <h2><strong>理解 JSG</strong></h2>JSG 致力于提供真实的体验，在扩展标准 MC 机制的同时引入其独特的系统。模组包含利用流体的新制作方法、通过结晶获取芽块的方式等等。最重要的是，大多数装置在开放世界中完全可交互！想拨号星门？你需要直接按下 DHD 上的按钮——无需图形界面。\n    </td>\n    <td> \n      <img src=\"https://vzge.me/bust/700/b9889cd78c4d4b3385bd2c1415363f17.png?y=-40\"> \n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/122/trailer.png\" alt=\"预告片\"><span><span><span><iframe width=\"1000\" height=\"560\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Bq9I--lW7eI?si=5Qkcbbsk0SEChTSv\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span><hr><table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <th>\n      <h2>寻找原版风格的星际之门模组？</h2>\n    </th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sgjourney\" rel=\"nofollow\">如果你更喜欢贴近经典 Minecraft 美学的模组，你一定要试试 Stargate Journey。Stargate Journey 是“Minecraft 风格”设计的杰作，巧妙地将星际之门宇宙与游戏的原版外观融合在一起。</a>\n    </th>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table><hr><table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td> \n      <img src=\"https://vzge.me/bust/700/086e262ede5040efbcc16131c3b7afa2.png\"> \n    </td>\n    <td>\n        <h2><strong>探索我们的附属模组</strong></h2>JSG 可以通过官方附属模组进行扩展。目前已推出引入《星际之门：宇宙》内容、装饰性方块和传送环的附属模组。传送环经过了重大改进，使其成为真正可行的短距离传送系统。\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table><table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td>\n      <h2><strong>认识艺术家</strong></h2>模组的视觉效果由两位关键人物完成，没有他们，JSG 就不会像今天这样光彩夺目。我们的图形团队最近迎来了一位新成员 EmrysHilda，她与资深艺术家 HaraldDeLuca 完美互补！<br> 本次更新包含了两位 3D 艺术家的作品，你可以期待他们未来创作出更多精彩内容。\n    </td>\n    <td> \n      <img src=\"https://vzge.me/bust/700/e46bf5eee4eb403f9054e27ae183e5c2.png?y=-40\"> \n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table><table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td> \n      <img src=\"https://vzge.me/bust/700/a398dd49-d995-4b49-9213-1ee9972240a3.png\">\n    </td>\n    <td>\n        <h2><strong>需要帮助？</strong></h2>如需最快速的支援，我们建议你前往我们的 Discord 或 GitHub。我们对这些平台的检查频率远高于此处的评论区。如果你发现错误或需要帮助，请在那里告知我们！\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/956/70/support.png\" alt=\"支持我们\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253dZYD4K634P5HQU\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/956/53/pp.png\" alt=\"PayPal 按钮\"></a><hr><table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <th>\n      <h2>鸣谢与致谢</h2>\n    </th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th>\n      我们以 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aunis\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aunis 模组</a>为基础构建了本项目。我们就此仓库与原作者保持联系，并保留了所有必要的署名。详情请参阅许可证。 <br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjustsgmod.eu%252fteam%252f%2523\" rel=\"nofollow\">— TauriDev 团队</a>\n    </th>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table><table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tbody><tr><th> \n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/minedragoncz_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/959/otherprojects.png\"></a>\n  </th></tr>\n</tbody></table><table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <th> \n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jsg\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1039/875/638565645126910597.png\">\n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th> \n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jsg-addon-rings\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1241/674/256/256/638812183885157132.png\"> \n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th> \n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jsg-addon-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1606/785/256/256/639037358820820174.png\"> \n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th> \n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jsg-addon-destiny\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1606/775/256/256/639037353864534454.png\"> \n      </a>\n    </th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jsg\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <strong>Just Stargate Mod</strong>\n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jsg-addon-rings\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <strong>传送环附属模组</strong>\n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jsg-addon-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <strong>装饰附属模组</strong>\n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jsg-addon-destiny\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <strong>命运号附属模组</strong>\n      </a>\n    </th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th> \n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/jsg-addon-origins\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/910/426/256/256/638364466607972492.png\">\n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th> \n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/jsg-sd\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/906/937/256/256/638357491075995069.png\"> \n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th> \n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/jsg-sample\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1375/167/256/256/638892438687767025.png\"> \n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th> \n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rsj\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/930/logo.png\"> \n      </a>\n    </th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/jsg-addon-origins\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <strong>额外起源</strong>\n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/jsg-sd\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <strong>SD 资源包</strong>\n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/jsg-sample\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <strong>示例资源包</strong>\n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rsj\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <strong>红石点唱机</strong>\n      </a>\n    </th>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>",
